    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "United Air Lines\nHonolulu/Hilo\nRECEI Fective Sept. 10, 1973\nSEP 0 4 1973\nJ. E. COCO\nMore 747's\nmore often, to more\nMainland cities\nThe\nfriendly\nskies of\nyour land",
      "Flya\nlittle Hawaii\nto the\nMainland.\nDon't leave Hawaii before you have to-\nfly United's little bit of Hawait home.\nEach 747 Friend Ship will extend your\nvacation through Hawaiian stewards, muumuu-\nclad stewardesses and the option of Polynesian\nfoods in United's Four Star dining. You'll have\nfree wine and champagne, too. Even in Coach.\nChoose United for those roomy 747's and the\nwidest schedule in the Islands.\nWith United, aloha doesn't come 'til home.\nThe friendly skies of your land.\nUnited Air Lines\nPartners in Travel\nwith Western International Hotels.\n1999. 047.351"
    ],
